// Title: PowerShell Script Run in AppData
// ID: ac175779-025a-4f12-98b0-acdaeb77ea85
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Jonhnathan Ribeiro, oscd.community
// Date: 2019-01-09
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects a suspicious command line execution that invokes PowerShell with reference to an AppData folder
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "powershell.exe") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\powershell") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\pwsh") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "pwsh.exe"))) AND ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/c ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\AppData\\")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Local\\") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Roaming\\"))))
